{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dA8dDEI9s01794530937.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國網絡設備巨頭思科第一季度業績好過市場預期，公司股價在延長交易時段曾升超過百分之8。</p><p></p><p>季內純利45.52億美元，按年增長五成九。經調整每股盈利1.4美元，收入185.1億美元。預期第二季度經調整每股盈利最高見1.36美元，全年度最高見5.53美元，第二季度收入最高182億美元，全年度最高758億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.803176+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:22.555402+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:00.648841+00:00","content_hash":"577ab6270448ea6c71399f15bba02760e38314a23ce6796a21d4ddc189faffc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.803176+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}